# REDUNDANT-ASTOBJ: a constructor call on a T-class (TStringList.Create, with or without
# parentheses) is already a class instance, so ' as TObject' is redundant (18, 19).
# A non-constructor call (20) and an interface cast (21) have a type the source does not show.
redundant-as-tobject 18
redundant-as-tobject 19
!redundant-as-tobject 20
!redundant-as-tobject 21
